WEBVTT

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.670
The Kokuboro. Who have
their sights set on Karasumori,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.230
have made their move.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.870
Ayakashi wearing human skin were sent
to school during the day.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.740
We're a bunch of suspicious people
and we're from Kokuboro.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.080
Kokuboro?!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.170
How did they get in here?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.550
Are they wearing human skin?!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.680
However. The Kokuboro
did nothing and left.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.400
They stated that
their main purpose was to talk.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.160
And that they wanted
to become human.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.660
That was why
they demanded Karasumori.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.540
Yoshimori and the others tried
to defend Karasumori.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.140
But Shishio was defeated.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.150
Yoshimori and Tokine were imprisoned

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.640
inside a Seal of Dispelling
that suppressed their powers.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.290
Do you want to bet on
my plan this time?

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:10.370
Sumimura Yoshimori.
A junior high student,

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.500
and Yukimura Tokine.
A high school student,

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.870
must guard the land where
their school now stands.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:19.010
To protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:21.340
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:27.180
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.050
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:34.260
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.160
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.590
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:44.000
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.540
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.870
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:56.540
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.040
Sha la la la la...

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:07.460
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.420
(Secret romance)

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:14.630
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.390
(A strange distance)

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:23.240
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.310
Yeah

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.780
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.380
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:36.720
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.990
Ketsu!

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.430
Ketsu!

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.150
So she escaped by going up?

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.470
That's interesting.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.180
Wh-What is this?!

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:14.020
Four Kekkai simultaneously?!

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.490
I can't cast Metsu on all four
of them at once!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.630
The boy ran away!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.990
Haizen!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:33.500
What?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.110
Thank you, Haizen!

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.770
Tokine!

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:51.720
Ketsu!

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:52.650
Metsu!

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:55.060
Ow. Ow. Ow! That hurt!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.830
What do we do now?
They escaped.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.570
The deal's off.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.970
What? But I like this look on me!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.870
I guess we have no choice.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.280
They're-!

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.550
It looks like anything can fit
inside that skin.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.630
What are they? They're huge!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:11.840
What?!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.830
Look up!

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.610
No! That rock has a Seal on it!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.670
Tokine!

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.140
Shishio!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:44.970
Gen-kun!

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:48.180
Sekia! I told you to take care
of the hostage!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.510
That's why I used
the Seal of Dispelling Rock!

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.910
He's not a Kekkaishi.
So it won't work on him!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.280
This is getting interesting,

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.490
but with the appearance of
the Half-Ayakashi,

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.220
they won't be able to handle this.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.180
I guess I should go.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.070
Run!

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.660
I can't do that!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.330
Run!

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.370
While I'm still standing!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:32.910
What?!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.460
Hi there.
Sorry to bother you.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.990
Y-You bastard!

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:41.650
I like that expression.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.090
I'll like it even more when I do this.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.060
Shishio!

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.370
Too slow. Way too slow.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.500
Why, you...

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.070
Wait!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.180
Gen-kun!
Don't go off on your own!

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.510
Oh no you don't!
You're fighting us!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.680
Haizen!

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.400
Wh-What is this?!

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.660
Tokine! Tokine!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.110
It's all right.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:28.770
This is just a smoke screen.
But next up is...

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:29.970
Haizen!

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.850
Not good!

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.190
Yoshimori! Over here!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:50.590
Kai!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:54.890
Damn!

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.240
I wonder if Gen-kun is okay...

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:58.630
He's fine.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.600
He won't lose.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:11.250
Oh? You're finished already?

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:13.550
You're not as fun as I thought.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.130
It's over.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.140
Stay there and rest
for the time being.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.310
I can kill you at any time,
you know.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:56.960
We know that you can't
cast your Kekkai and surround us

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.730
unless you can see
our exact location.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:03.770
Just admit defeat and surrender...
just like the humans you are.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.070
No answer?

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.350
Sekia. Haroku!
Finish them off!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.450
Let's have some fun!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.930
Now then.
I wonder how things are going?

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.400
I can't see with this smoke.
This isn't any fun.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.760
No... I entrusted Karasumori to him.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.660
Damn! I can't move!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.090
Gen-kun...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.320
He's injured but he still
jumped in to save us.

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:44.840
I have to pay him back for that,
I can't let him die!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.800
That's right.
I have to repay him, too.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.340
Even in this weird rain.
The Kekkai holds for a little while.

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.810
We have to make it quick.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.310
Are you taking the lead here?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:58.810
Stop.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.190
We have to corner them more.
Haizen!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.690
You can go all out!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:31.880
Over there! Tokine!

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:33.350
Melt them. Haizen!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.450
Ketsu!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.490
Haizen!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.520
Ketsu!

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.060
Metsu!

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.510
They abandoned Haizen.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.550
He was the best fighter.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:02.610
The fools.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:08.380
All right! Your plan worked!

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:10.950
We've turned the tide now.

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.720
But I'm almost at my limit...

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.360
Leave the rest to me.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.290
I'm counting on you.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.470
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:31.170
You were beating us before,
but now it's our turn!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.330
Ketsu!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.740
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.410
Stop running away!

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:41.780
Ketsu!

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.250
Metsu!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.260
H-Haroku!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.120
Ketsu!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:49.850
You're mine!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:52.890
What?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.970
Th-Thanks. Sanan.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.730
Sekia.

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.900
I have a job for you.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:04.750
I don't know about this.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:09.050
The battle is pretty much over.
They're just being sore losers now.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:19.760
That bastard.
He made a fool out of me... twice.

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.860
That bastard!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.960
I'll get you for this!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.830
Go do your job!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:32.500
If you can't,
I'll tear you up this instant! Go!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.970
What are they going to do next?

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.780
What's this staggering Negative Energy?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:47.350
This feeling...
It must be him.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.610
Gen-kun?!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.560
He seems to be doing all right.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:55.120
Oh, my. Now that other kid
is fully awake.

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.920
I'm not going to help anymore.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:14:00.160
It's your own fault
for being so slow.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:03.460
Damn! Hey!
Stop circling around!

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:11.570
Tokine!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.410
Yoshimori!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.810
Tokine!

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:47.910
Stop making such a commotion,
you monster.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.080
Wh-Who is it?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.600
It finally stopped.

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.300
Hiba-san...

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.670
If you're still itching to fight,
I'll inject a lethal amount of poison into you.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:20.240
Shishio, I'm sure you know what happens
when you break the taboo.

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:22.850
But... that bastard...

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:28.910
The Negative Energy disappeared.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.880
Did Shishio?
It can't be...

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:34.850
Tokine...

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.060
I'm sorry, Shishio!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:52.400
Tokine!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:56.310
Surrender right now... or else...

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:06.220
Oh, man. It's against my aesthetics to
take a woman as a hostage... huh?

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:10.890
Let her go.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.870
Huh? I can't hear you.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.230
Let her go.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.200
I said, let her go.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.010
That's...

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.000
What?!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:39.030
Why? We were almost...

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.600
You know... your fighting style
lacks aesthetics.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.390
Wh-What?

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.110
Tokine! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.240
Tokine!

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:07.990
Don't take that the wrong way...

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:11.950
I didn't do it to save her.
I couldn't bear to watch them anymore.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.290
I just don't think it's right to
take a woman hostage.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:20.300
It's crucial for a warrior to
have aesthetics.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.660
Are you trying to interfere?
Get out of my way.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:29.870
You're kind of interesting.
Say, do that thing again.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.370
What thing?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:35.670
Oh? I guess you don't know.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:40.010
I thought it was getting interesting,
so I had them die.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.450
I guess it was all wasted.

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.890
People like you appear
from time to time.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.790
People that can do that through
innate talent alone.

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.390
But it's unfortunate that
you don't even know it.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:53.630
Shut up!
Just get out of my way!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:59.370
Not this.
It's not interesting at all.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.500
Damn!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.070
What?!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.280
Points-wise, you top out at 50.

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:11.340
I guess you pass, but only because
I'm hopeful for your potential.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.380
I will withdraw for tonight.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:18.580
My name is Kaguro.
Remember that.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.550
Besides, my time is up.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:26.070
I recovered the human skin,
and now I know who our opponents are.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.940
I think that's good enough for today.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:49.410
Tokine!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.290
Tokine! Tokine!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.230
Tokine! Are you all right?!

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.230
Yeah...

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:08.630
I'm sorry.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:09.970
Thanks...

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.210
It's from earlier...

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:24.550
I'm sorry!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.260
I did it again. I'm sorry.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.000
You got another scar
where people can see...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:34.090
Come on. I'm fine.
This will heal in no time.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.860
And why are you apologizing?

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.370
It's not your fault!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.170
No... I...

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.500
I said I'm fine!

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.010
Come on!
We have to go find Gen-kun.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:45.610
Who's there?!

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:46.600
What's wrong?

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:52.880
Hold on.
I'm with the Night Troops.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.010
See?

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:56.980
Night Troops?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.850
My name is Hiba Kyoichi.
Nice to meet you.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.560
What are you doing to Shishio?!

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.520
He tried to break the taboo.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:05.160
That's why I knocked him out.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.460
The taboo?

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:10.190
He almost went berserk again.

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.200
But you don't have to worry.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:18.470
I'll report that he broke the taboo
and he'll be relieved of his post.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.940
Wait! What are you talking about?

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.980
My older brother assigned him here
to be our assistant without any warning.

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:26.210
And now you're just
taking him away?!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:30.310
Hey, why are you mad?
This is for your sake.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.290
You felt that Negative Energy,
didn't you?

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.560
He's a monster.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:40.570
He can't even follow the basic rules.
And he can't control himself.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:42.060
You sure you want to work with him?

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.440
All he knows is how to destroy things.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.270
Wait, you don't have to say it like that.

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.810
It makes sense that his family
abandoned him.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.400
He's barely able to stay in
the Shadow Organization, too.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:53.650
Did you know?

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:55.280
His sister was...

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:56.270
Stop!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:59.440
Shishio!

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:02.820
Shishio. Pack your things.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:09.020
Shishio! Wait!

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:10.230
Shishio!

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:11.220
Gen-kun!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:12.820
I'm going back.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:16.990
Shishio!

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:35.890
You're back.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:39.860
Having to report to Byaku every
single time can be a real pain.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.000
You'll have to go sooner or later.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.590
You have one of his worms inside you.

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:48.530
Where are Haizen and the others?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.590
They're dead.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:51.900
I recovered the human skin.

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:57.180
What is Byaku thinking,
trying to talk to the Kekkaishi?

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:01.240
I don't know. I never know
what Byaku is thinking.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.680
Shouldn't you know better?

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.950
Both of you used to be human.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.820
Speaking of humans...

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:10.720
I found some interesting ones.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:12.760
A Half-Ayakashi brat,

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:18.430
and another who made me feel excited
for the first time in a very long time.

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:50.460
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:53.730
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:57.890
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:01.500
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:05.300
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:09.280
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:13.340
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:13.390 --> 00:23:16.620
I am, it's common sense

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:20.960
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:26.930
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:33.270
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:35.240
(if that's true)

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:39.940
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:43.380
Please Please Please

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:47.580
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:50.920
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:55.190
You watch from far away

00:23:55.230 --> 00:24:01.190
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:03.300
Hey Hey
